hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1060","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Khalid bin Zaid Juhani se, jo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahabi hain, riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se sonay ya chandi ki giri pari cheez ke baaray mein poocha gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ke bandhan aur us ki thaili ko pehchan lo, phir aik saal tak us ka elaan karo, phir agar usay pehchana na jaye to usay kharch kar lo aur wo tumharay paas amanat rahay, phir agar kabhi us ka talib aa jaye to usay usay ada kar do. Aur Aap se gumshuda oont ke baaray mein poocha gaya to farmaya: Tumhein us se kya (kaam)? Usay chhor do, beshak us ke saath us ke paon aur us ka pani ka bartan hai, wo pani par aata hai aur darakht (ke pattay) khata hai yahan tak ke us ka maalik usay paa le. Aur Aap se bakri ke baaray mein poocha gaya to farmaya: Usay pakar lo, beshak wo tumharay liye hai ya tumharay bhai ke liye ya bhediye ke liye. (Muslim: 5/135). Baab: Haaji ki giri pari cheez ke baaray mein."
"1061","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Usman Taimi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne haaji ki giri pari (cheez uthanay) se mana farmaya. (Muslim: 5/137). Baab: Jo gumshuda (cheez ya janwar) ko panah de wo gumrah hai."
"1062","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Khalid Juhani (raziyallahu anhu) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs gumshuda cheez ko panah de wo gumrah hai jab tak us ka elaan na karay. (Muslim: 5/137). Baab: Logon ke maweshiyon ka doodh un ki ijazat ke baghair dohnay ki mumaniat."
"1063","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi shakhs kisi ke maweshi ka doodh us ki ijazat ke baghair na dohaye. Kya tum mein se koi ye pasand karta hai ke us ke khazanay (kotri) mein aaya jaye, phir us ka khazana tor diya jaye aur us ka khana utha liya jaye? Beshak un ke maweshiyon ke than un ke khanay ke khazanay hain, to koi shakhs kisi ke maweshi ka doodh us ki ijazat ke baghair na dohaye. (Muslim: 5/137). (Haashiya: Wika us dhaagay ko kehtay hain jis se bartan bandha jata hai, aur ifaas wo thaili hai jis mein kharch (sonay chandi ke sikkay) hon; amanat honay ka matlab usay kharch karnay ke baad lautana wajib honay hai; mashruba wo buland jagah hai jahan khana aur samaan zakheera kiya jata hai.)"
